[nas]
packageDescription="View your Pome Panel workspace on the NAS and pair with the desktop app. The interface uses the unified gateway /app/pome-panel. The gateway starts even without a configured port. Device sync defaults to 127.0.0.1, with optional LAN listening on 0.0.0.0."
packageChangelog="0.9.14: Device sync supports optional LAN listening (0.0.0.0), with localhost (127.0.0.1) as the default. App Settings adds Listen scope. The startup entry remains TRIM_APPDEST/server and the sync protocol remains in target/packages/sync-protocol. Uninstall can keep or delete app data."

